{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, דָּא","hw":"דָּא","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּא</span></big></big>  <strong>demonstr. pr. f. this (</strong>= BH <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹה</span>: Zinj. Têma, Cappad. Egyptian Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">זא</span>, Nab. <span dir=\"rtl\">דא</span>, Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">דה</span> (Lzb <sup>264; Eph. i. 323</sup> Cooke <sup>26</sup>), 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">דא</span>: v. further sub BH <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶה</span>. The corresp. masc. is <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּנָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—<em>this</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:27\" href=\"/Daniel.4.27\">Dn 4:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲלָא דָא הִיא בָּבֶל רַבְּתָא</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:6\" href=\"/Daniel.5.6\">5:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּא לְדָא נָֽקְשָׁן</span> <em>one</em> striking <em>another</em>, cf.<a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:3\" href=\"/Daniel.7.3\">7:3</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זֶה\" href=\"/BDB,_זֶה\", dir=\"rtl\">זֶה</a> <strong>1 b</strong>), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְקַרְנָא־דָא</span>. <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּארִין</span> v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, דּוּר\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_דּוּר\", dir=\"rtl\">דּוּר</a>].","next":"BDB Aramaic, דֹּב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, גְּשֵׁם"}